<p class="lt-chem-13786">Elements in Groups 1, 2, and 3 tend to form 1+, 2+, and 3+ ions, respectively; elements in Groups 15, 16, and 17 tend to form 3&minus;, 2&minus;, and 1&minus; ions, respectively.</p>
</div></div>

